          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(iii) Are the following statements correct?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.234,
            0.114,
            0.845,
            0.152
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) The average time spent daily on hobbies and games by kids aged 15 is twice that of kids aged 10."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.236,
            0.155,
            0.576,
            0.213
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) All rural kids aged 15 spend at least 1 hour on hobbies and games everyday."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.216,
            0.576,
            0.272
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "12. Individual project: Make your own activity strip for different days of the week."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.205,
            0.277,
            0.576,
            0.334
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) Do you eat and sleep at regular times every day? Typically how long do you spend outdoors?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.596,
            0.154,
            0.892,
            0.309
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
